SUMMARY:Amazing Insects of the World
DESCRIPTION:There are over 1.5 million described insects on our planet\, from tiny fairy flies to rhinocerus beetles.  Join the ecoEXPLORE Central NC team to learn more about some of the weirdest\, most amazing insects in this virtual program! \nRegister
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/amazing-insects-of-the-world/
LOCATION:Virtual\, NC\, United States
CATEGORIES:Children,Collaborative Science,ecoEXPLORE,K-12 Students,Teens,Virtual
ORGANIZER;CN="ecoEXPLORE%20Team":MAILTO:ecoexplore@naturalsciences.org
END:VEVENT
